  "id": "reyosterrieth-complex-figure-test",
  "term": "Rey–Osterrieth Complex Figure Test",
  "definition": "The Rey–Osterrieth Complex Figure Test is a neuropsychological assessment of cognitive function that uses a complex geometric drawing task. It typically includes copying the figure and later drawing it again from memory to evaluate visuospatial construction, perceptual organization, executive functioning, and visual memory.",
